{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾等誦觀經諸讚念佛竟。即誦此琮法師導和上淨土禮讚。誦禮讚竟。即誦後發願文便散"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此門但明生淨土當來證聖果已。化生利物意。不應誦今之法事禮\n讚竟。且須誦後第十門中天台迴向發願文。應知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即唱隨意便散"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十八偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿彌陀佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿彌陀佛。後須有阿彌陀佛。阿彌陀佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿彌陀佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南無彌陀佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准前和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已後讚諸依前第三會念佛和之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和准前定"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通一切處誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此讚通一切處誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通一切處誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此讚大會時誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "法國國家圖書館敦煌寫本P."}
